      },
      "worked": "Line (1) misuses the power law: $\\log_2(8^2)=2\\log_2 8$, whereas $(\\log_2 8)^2$ squares the logarithm itself.\n$$\\begin{align*}(\\log_2 8)^2&=3^2\\\\(\\log_2 8)^2&=9.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
